BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20260811T203849Z
CATEGORIES:Holiday
SUMMARY:🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿 Burns Night 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁳󠁣󠁴
 󠁿
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250125
